# Hugin project file template - 72-Shot Symmetrical Grid
# Camera: Sony A6600 (APS-C, 3:2 Aspect Ratio) | Lens: 28mm Portrait (4024x6024 px)
# Layout: 9 Upper (+67.5 deg), 18 Mid-Sky (+37.5 deg), 18 Horizon (0 deg), 18 Ground (-37.5 deg), 9 Lower (-67.5 deg)

p f2 w3092 h1546 v360  k0 E0 R0 n"TIFF_m c:LZW r:CROP"

